    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e5229e1bf954bee0e04f499",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……メジロブライト。メジロ家のウマ娘で、\nとても温和な雰囲気を纏っているが――",
      "source_fingerprint": "449245d1ea32e7642c9721b0ff3096fc97ed8d5befee267e08d88afd5d2f46cf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1119/storytimeline_501119206.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        15,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/15/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78b6ead157f9d63df3e00808",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "彼女はメジロマックイーンと同様、\n『天皇賞（春）』に勝利した経験のある、\nれっきとしたメジロの栄光の子である。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c91c3614943d16c0623c60981879dc9597cfa2588f0c234d6672090ef146b1ca",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1119/storytimeline_501119206.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        16,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/16/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4fd6ea6e96e95333cebb074",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "そして何より……――\n彼女はステイゴールドと同期のウマ娘で、\n正に『天皇賞（春）』でも競った存在なのだ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5788b310d50f76fc015c4f79ec852017a2c5004d91c70f9d3d576f0d620cadd7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1119/storytimeline_501119206.json",
      "json_path": [
